{{also|ня|-на|на-|-ња|Appendix:Variations of "na"}}
==Bulgarian==

===Pronunciation 1===
{{rfc-pron-n|Pronunciation 1|lang=bg}}
* {{qualifier|stressed}} {{IPA|/na/|lang=bg}}
* {{qualifier|unstressed}} {{IPA|/nə/|/nɐ/|lang=bg}}

====Preposition====
{{head|bg|preposition}}

# {{non-gloss definition|used to express possession}}, [[of#Preposition|of]], [['s#Particle|'s]]
#: {{ux|bg|София е столицата '''на''' България.|inline=1|Sofia is the capital of Bulgaria.}}
#: {{ux|bg|къщата '''на''' баща ми|inline=1|my father's house}}
# {{non-gloss definition|used to indicate the [[indirect object]]}}, [[to#Preposition|to]] {{qualifier|or it's not translated}}
#: {{ux|bg|Дай го '''на''' Петър.|inline=1|Give it to Peter.}}
#: {{ux|bg|Дай '''на''' Петър една книга.|inline=1|Give Peter a book.}}
# {{non-gloss definition|used with nouns formed from intransitive verbs to indicate the subject of the action}}, [[of#Preposition|of]]
#: {{ux|bg|пристигането '''на''' гостите|inline=1|the arrival of the guests}}
#: {{ux|bg|избухването '''на''' войната|inline=1|the outbreak of the war}}
# {{non-gloss definition|used with nouns formed from transitive verbs to indicate the direct object of the action}}, [[of#Preposition|of]]
#: {{ux|bg|четенето '''на''' книгата|inline=1|the reading of the book}}
#: {{ux|bg|изобретяването '''на''' компютъра|inline=1|the invention of the computer}}
# {{non-gloss definition|used with some verbs such as [[уча]], [[мириша]], etc. to give a description of the action}}
#: {{ux|bg|Дъхът му миришеше '''на''' чесън.|inline=1|His breath smelt of garlic.}}
#: {{ux|bg|Опитът ни на бежанци ни научи '''на''' много ценни уроци.|inline=1|Our experience as refugees taught us many valuable lessons.}}
# positioned at the upper surface of, within the limits of, [[on#Preposition|on]], [[upon#Preposition|on]], [[at#Preposition|at]], [[in#Preposition|in]]
#: {{ux|bg|Книгата е '''на''' масата.|inline=1|The book is on the table.}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''на''' двора|inline=1|in the yard}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''на''' море|inline=1|at the seaside}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''на''' планина|inline=1|in the mountain}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''на''' сватба|inline=1|at a wedding}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''на''' север|inline=1|in the north}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''на''' улицата|inline=1|in the street}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''на''' училище съм|inline=1|to be at school}}
#: {{ux|bg|седя '''на''' масата|inline=1|to sit at the table}}
# {{non-gloss definition|used to show direction}}, [[to#Preposition|to]], [[on#Preposition|on]]
#: {{ux|bg|Отивам '''на''' плажа.|inline=1|I'm going to the beach.}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''на''' ляво/дясно|inline=1|on the left/right}}
# {{non-gloss definition|used to indicate destination}}, in the direction of, and arriving at, [[on#Preposition|on]], [[to#Preposition|to]], [[for#Preposition|for]]
#: {{ux|bg|отивам '''на''' училище|inline=1|to go to school}}
#: {{ux|bg|отивам '''на''' работа|inline=1|to go to work}}
#: {{ux|bg|отивам '''на''' почивка|inline=1|to go on a holiday}}
#: {{ux|bg|отивам '''на''' разходка|inline=1|to go for a walk}}
#: {{ux|bg|ходя '''на''' лов/риба/ски/покупки|inline=1|to go hunting/fishing/skiing/shopping}}
# {{non-gloss definition|used to introduce a noun phrase that describes the verb, or if it is a linking verb, to describe the subject of the verb}}
#: {{ux|bg|Времето е '''на''' дъжд.|inline=1|It looks like rain.}}
#: {{ux|bg|Вятърът духа '''на''' пролет.|inline=1|The wind is blowing in a way that suggests that spring is coming.}}
#: {{ux|bg|да обичаш '''на''' инат|inline=1|to love stubbornly}}
# {{non-gloss definition|used to show a reason or cause}}, [[for#Preposition|for]]
#: {{ux|bg|Събрахме се '''на''' вечеря.|inline=1|We gathered for dinner.}}
#: {{ux|bg|Занесох колелото си '''на''' поправка.|inline=1|I took my bike in for repair.}}
# {{non-gloss definition|used with certain time expressions to show when something happens}}, [[on#Preposition|on]], [[at#Preposition|at]], [[in#Preposition|in]] {{qualifier|or it is not translated}}
#: {{ux|bg|Роден '''на''' 4 юли.|inline=1|Born on the 4th of July.}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''На''' следващия ден имах изпит.|inline=1|I had an exam (on) the following day.}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''На''' сутринта имах ужасен махмурлук.|inline=1|I had a terrible hangover in the morning.}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''на''' залез слънце|inline=1|at sunset}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''на''' часа|inline=1|immediately/at once}}
# {{non-gloss definition|used to introduce a verbal noun and to indicate that the action described by the verbal noun happens at the same time as another action, [[while#Conjunction|while]], [[when#Conjunction|when]]}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''На''' тръгване го погледна още веднъж.|inline=1|When/While he/she was leaving, he/she looked at him once more.}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''На''' връщане минахме по по-кратък път.|inline=1|When we were coming back we took a shortcut.}}
# {{non-gloss definition|used with [[от#Bulgarian|от]] to indicate the period over which something happens}}, [[to#Preposition|to]]
#: {{ux|bg|от време '''на''' време|inline=1|from time to time}}
#: {{ux|bg|от ден '''на''' ден|inline=1|from day to day}}
# {{non-gloss definition|used to show the circumstances under which something happens}}, [[with#Preposition|with]], [[in#Preposition|in]]
#: {{ux|bg|спя '''на''' запалена лампа|inline=1|to sleep with the light turned on}}
#: {{ux|bg|стоя '''на''' студено/топло|inline=1|to stay in a cold/warm place}}
# {{non-gloss definition|used to show age}}, [[at#Preposition|at]]
#: {{ux|bg|Тя е '''на''' 12 години.|inline=1|She is 12 years old.}}
#: {{ux|bg|Той се ожени '''на''' 28.|inline=1|He got married at 28.}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''на''' 20-годишна възраст|inline=1|at the age of 20}}
# {{non-gloss definition|used to indicate the distance away from something}}, [[at#Preposition|at]] {{qualifier|or it is not translated}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''на''' една ръка разстояние|inline=1|at arm's length}}
#: {{ux|bg|Той стоеше '''на''' няколко метра от мен.|inline=1|He was standing a few metres away from me.}}
# {{non-gloss definition|used to indicate the quantity used for buying, selling or measuring something}}, [[by#Preposition|by]]
#: {{ux|bg|продавам '''на''' метър/литър|inline=1|to sell by the metre/litre}}
#: {{ux|bg|работя '''на''' парче|inline=1|to work by the piece}}
# {{non-gloss definition|used to separate dimensions when describing the size of something}}, [[by#Preposition|by]]
#: {{ux|bg|Лесно е да обърнеш 2 '''на''' 2 матрица.|inline=1|It is easy to invert a 2 by 2 matrix.}}
#: {{ux|bg|Стаята беше около 4 '''на''' 6 фута.|inline=1|The room was about 4 foot by 6 foot.}}
#: {{ux|bg|Използвахме 10 '''на''' 20 '''на''' 30 сантиметрови тухли, за да построим станата.|inline=1|We used 10 by 20 by 30 cm bricks to build the wall.}}
# {{non-gloss definition|used to indicate the rate at which something happens}}, [[per#Preposition|per]], [[by#Preposition|by]], [[a#Preposition|a]]
#: {{ux|bg|два пъти '''на''' ден/месец/година|inline=1|twice a day/mouth/year}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''на''' глава|inline=1|per capita/head}}
#: {{ux|bg|Плащат им '''на''' час.|inline=1|They are paid by the hour.}}
#: {{ux|bg|по пет лева '''на''' човек|inline=1|five levs each/five levs apiece/five levs per head}}
# {{non-gloss definition|used to indicate the parts into which something is divided}}, [[in#Preposition|in]], [[into#Preposition|into]], [[by#Preposition|by]]
#: {{ux|bg|разделям '''на''' две|inline=1|to divide in two}}
#: {{ux|bg|режа '''на''' парчета|inline=1|to cut in/into pieces}}
#: {{ux|bg|6 делено '''на''' 2 прави 3.|inline=1|6 divided by 2 equals 3.}}
# {{non-gloss definition|used to show how or in what way something is done}}, [[by#Preposition|by]], [[in#Preposition|in]]
#: {{ux|bg|Учениците пристигнаха '''на''' малки групи.|inline=1|The students arrived in small groups.}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''на''' голо|inline=1|on/over one's bare skin/next to the skin}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''на''' дело|inline=1|in practice}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''на''' теория|inline=1|in theory}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''на''' ръка|inline=1|by hand}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''на''' дребно|inline=1|retail}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''на''' едро|inline=1|wholesale}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''на''' кръст|inline=1|crosswise}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''на''' шега|inline=1|for fun}}
# {{non-gloss definition|used to indicate a change in state}}, [[to#Preposition|to]], [[into#Preposition|into]]
#: {{ux|bg|ставам '''на''' прах|inline=1|to turn in/into dust}}
#: {{ux|bg|счупвам се '''на''' парчета|inline=1|to break in/into pieces}}
#: {{ux|bg|преструвам се '''на''' някого|inline=1|to pretend to be someone/to impersonate someone}}
#: {{ux|bg|правя се '''на''' болен|inline=1|to feign illness}}
# {{non-gloss definition|used to indicate an instrument}}
#: {{ux|bg|работя '''на''' машина|inline=1|to run/operate a machine}}
#: {{ux|bg|свиря '''на''' пиано|inline=1|to play the piano}}
#: {{ux|bg|гледам '''на''' карти|inline=1|to fortune tell using a deck of cards}}
#: {{ux|bg|гледам '''на''' кафе|inline=1|to fortune tell using coffee}}
#: {{ux|bg|броя '''на''' пръсти|inline=1|to count along one's fingers}}
# {{non-gloss definition|used to indicate a game}}
#: {{ux|bg|играя '''на''' шах|inline=1|to play chess}}
# [[near#Preposition|near]], [[close to#Preposition|close to]]
#: {{ux|bg|Суматранските тигри са '''на''' изчезване.|inline=1|Sumatran tigers are near extinction.}}
#: {{ux|bg|Припасите ни са '''на''' свършване.|inline=1|Our supplies are running low.}}
# {{non-gloss definition|used to indicate a language, a way of speaking, etc.}}, [[in#Preposition|in]]
#: {{ux|bg|Кажи го '''на''' английски.|inline=1|Say it in English.}}
#: {{ux|bg|Той говореше '''на''' висок глас.|inline=1|He spoke in a loud voice.}}

